@startuml Sequence_CICD_Pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #1F4E79
skinparam participantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participantBorderColor #0D3A5C
skinparam participantFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam noteBorderColor #CC9900
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6
skinparam lifelineBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam activationBackgroundColor #D6E4F0
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Stock Options Predictor - Sequence Diagram: CI/CD Pipeline Execution

actor "Developer" as Dev #2E75B6
participant "GitHub\nRepository" as GitHub #2E7D32
participant "Jenkins\nPipeline" as Jenkins #C62828
participant "Maven\nBuild Tool" as Maven #E65100
participant "SonarQube\nServer" as Sonar #6A1B9A
participant "Docker\nEngine" as Docker #0277BD
participant "Deployment\nTarget" as Deploy #37474F

== Stage 1: Trigger ==

Dev -> Dev : git add .\ngit commit -m "feat: add OLS regression endpoint"
Dev -> GitHub : git push origin main

activate GitHub #C8E6C9
GitHub -> Jenkins : Webhook: POST /github-webhook/\n{ ref: "refs/heads/main", commit: "a3f9b21" }
deactivate GitHub

activate Jenkins #FFCDD2

== Stage 2: Checkout ==

Jenkins -> GitHub : git clone / git checkout a3f9b21
activate GitHub #C8E6C9
GitHub --> Jenkins : Source code (stock-predictor/)
deactivate GitHub

== Stage 3: Build ==

Jenkins -> Maven : mvn clean package -DskipTests -B
activate Maven #FFE0B2
Maven -> Maven : Compile sources\nResolve dependencies\nPackage JAR
Maven --> Jenkins : BUILD SUCCESS\ntarget/stock-predictor-1.0.0.jar
deactivate Maven

Jenkins -> Jenkins : archiveArtifacts(target/*.jar)

== Stage 4: Unit Tests ==

Jenkins -> Maven : mvn test -B
activate Maven #FFE0B2
Maven -> Maven : Run PredictionServiceTest\n(10 Mockito-isolated tests)\nJaCoCo agent active
Maven --> Jenkins : Tests: 10 passed, 0 failed\ntarget/surefire-reports/*.xml
deactivate Maven
Jenkins -> Jenkins : junit(target/surefire-reports/**/*.xml)

== Stage 5: Integration Tests ==

Jenkins -> Maven : mvn verify -B
activate Maven #FFE0B2
Maven -> Maven : Boot Spring context (H2)\nRun PredictionControllerIntegrationTest\n(10 MockMvc tests)\nJaCoCo generates jacoco.xml
Maven --> Jenkins : Tests: 20 passed, 0 failed\nLine coverage: 84%  [>= 70%: PASS]
deactivate Maven

Jenkins -> Jenkins : jacoco(minimumLineCoverage: 70)\n[PASS]

== Stage 6: Code Quality Analysis ==

Jenkins -> Maven : mvn sonar:sonar\n-Dsonar.token=***\n-Dsonar.coverage.jacoco.xmlReportPaths=...
activate Maven #FFE0B2
Maven -> Sonar : POST /api/ce/submit\n{ projectKey: "stock-predictor",\n  coverage: 84%, bugs: 0,\n  vulnerabilities: 0, smells: 3 }
activate Sonar #E1BEE7
Sonar --> Maven : { taskId: "AYx7j2..." }
deactivate Sonar
Maven --> Jenkins : Analysis submitted
deactivate Maven

== Stage 7: Quality Gate ==

Jenkins -> Sonar : waitForQualityGate()\nGET /api/qualitygates/project_status?projectKey=stock-predictor
activate Sonar #E1BEE7
Sonar --> Jenkins : { status: "OK",\n  conditions: [\n    { metric: "coverage", status: "OK", value: "84" },\n    { metric: "new_bugs", status: "OK", value: "0" }\n  ] }
deactivate Sonar

Jenkins -> Jenkins : Quality Gate: PASSED\n[abortPipeline: false]

== Stage 8: Docker Image Build ==

Jenkins -> Docker : docker build -t stock-predictor:42 .
activate Docker #BBDEFB
Docker -> Docker : Stage 1 (builder): maven:3.9 image\nmvn package -DskipTests\nStage 2 (runtime): eclipse-temurin:17-jre-alpine\nCOPY stock-predictor-1.0.0.jar app.jar\nADD USER appuser (non-root)
Docker --> Jenkins : Image built: stock-predictor:42\ndocker tag stock-predictor:42 stock-predictor:latest
deactivate Docker

== Stage 9: Deploy ==

Jenkins -> Deploy : docker stop stock-predictor || true\ndocker rm stock-predictor || true
activate Deploy #B0BEC5
Deploy --> Jenkins : Container removed

Jenkins -> Deploy : docker run -d --name stock-predictor\n-p 8080:8080 --restart unless-stopped\nstock-predictor:latest
Deploy -> Deploy : JVM startup\nSpring Boot auto-config\nH2 schema created\nDataInitializer: seed 180 records
Deploy --> Jenkins : Container ID: d3a1f9c7...

Jenkins -> Deploy : sleep 20s\ncurl --fail http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Deploy --> Jenkins : 200 OK  { "status": "UP" }
deactivate Deploy

Jenkins --> Dev : Pipeline #42 SUCCESS\nDuration: 5m 43s\nDeployed: stock-predictor:latest
deactivate Jenkins

== Failure Path: Quality Gate Failure ==

note over Jenkins, Sonar
  If SonarQube returns { status: "ERROR" }
  (e.g. coverage < 70% or blocker bug found):
  waitForQualityGate() throws exception
  → Pipeline ABORTED at Stage 7
  → Docker build and Deploy are SKIPPED
  → Developer notified of gate failure
end note

@enduml
